      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah so I think I figured out why this happens and how to get it to happen consistently. If I happen to open the steamvr menu (like when I accidently press the button on my HMD when putting it back on) before pressing the QM button to reload into 3 pt tracking, that's what causes it to not work. This doesn't happen on Live I believe.",
