  "details": "Repro steps:\n1.) Put on FBT and calibrate\n2.) Now take off trackers and turn them all off\n3.) Put headset on and open your QM\nExpected result: When you open your QM after turning your trackers off, observe as your pretzeled avatar reloads back in 3 pt tracking. (This works on Live.)\nActual result: Nothing happens, avatar remains mangled.\n\nJust as a note though, when you change your avatar or reload another way, everything works as intended.",
